# Generated by scripts/generate-sitemap.ts during prebuild. Tracking it in git means the
# committed copy silently drifts from source — it was 5 days stale on 2026-08-05 and
# caused a wrong audit diagnosis. Production always regenerates it. Verify against
# https://mychef.id/sitemap.xml or read src/data/sitemap.ts instead.
public/sitemap.xml
